{
  "source": "Prompts/avoid-opener-1.mp4",
  "duration": 189.8695625,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.08,
      "text": "The exact same underlying machinery that makes artificial intelligence so powerful"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.54,
      "end": 9.58,
      "text": "also causes it to fail in highly specific, predictable ways."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.28,
      "end": 13.84,
      "text": "The catch is, when an AI system breaks down or makes an error,"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.54,
      "end": 16.8,
      "text": "the output does not look glitchy or broken."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.7,
      "end": 22.62,
      "text": "A completely fabricated fact will be delivered to you with absolute unwavering certainty."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.38,
      "end": 27.6,
      "text": "A subtle inaccuracy might be wrapped up in flattery and highly polished language"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.6,
      "end": 29.24,
      "text": "that naturally makes you feel good."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.92,
      "end": 34.08,
      "text": "And an entirely fake image will pass seamlessly as authentic reality."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.24,
      "end": 38.78,
      "text": "If you try to judge an AI's output, relying solely on human intuition,"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.5,
      "end": 42.38,
      "text": "trusting it simply because the answer looks or feels right,"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.86,
      "end": 44.82,
      "text": "you are walking directly into a trap."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.66,
      "end": 49.62,
      "text": "To understand this, we have to step away from technology and look at the ocean."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.44,
      "end": 53.56,
      "text": "Nature also hides its most dangerous traps in plain sight."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.14,
      "end": 56.94,
      "text": "If you stand on a shoreline, you might see what looks like"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.94,
      "end": 61.18,
      "text": "a perfectly calm, flat channel of water nestled right between two sections"
    },
    {
      "start": 61.18,
      "end": 62.68,
      "text": "of turbulent breaking waves."
    },
    {
      "start": 63.54,
      "end": 67.42,
      "text": "To the untrained eye, this stretch of calm water appears to be the safest spot"
    },
    {
      "start": 67.42,
      "end": 68.38,
      "text": "on the entire beach."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.22,
      "end": 74.12,
      "text": "But if you wade into that channel, you will be swiftly and unstoppably pulled"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.12,
      "end": 75.4,
      "text": "far away from the shore."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.28,
      "end": 79.04,
      "text": "Artificial intelligence behaves the exact same way."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.66,
      "end": 81.84,
      "text": "The danger isn't chaos or turbulence."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.4,
      "end": 86.44,
      "text": "The trap is the illusion of calm, frictionless safety."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.38,
      "end": 90.2,
      "text": "Surviving a rip current has nothing to do with physical strength"
    },
    {
      "start": 90.2,
      "end": 93.48,
      "text": "or trying to outswim the water once you're caught inside it."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.22,
      "end": 97.0,
      "text": "The true survival skill is recognizing the invisible current"
    },
    {
      "start": 97.0,
      "end": 99.44,
      "text": "before you ever make the decision to enter the water."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.22,
      "end": 102.68,
      "text": "Think about how a lifeguard successfully watches over the beach"
    },
    {
      "start": 102.68,
      "end": 104.3,
      "text": "all day without falling into these traps."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.04,
      "end": 106.82,
      "text": "They don't avoid rip currents by luck."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.82,
      "end": 111.9,
      "text": "They are specifically trained to recognize the distinct geometric shape"
    },
    {
      "start": 111.9,
      "end": 114.04,
      "text": "the dangerous water makes against the sand."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.6,
      "end": 118.78,
      "text": "Navigating a deceptive environment requires you to abandon naive trust."
    },
    {
      "start": 119.5,
      "end": 123.64,
      "text": "You must adopt a trained analytical mindset to see the hidden structures"
    },
    {
      "start": 123.64,
      "end": 125.0,
      "text": "that everyone else misses."
    },
    {
      "start": 125.86,
      "end": 128.58,
      "text": "When you are using AI, you are swimming in water"
    },
    {
      "start": 128.58,
      "end": 130.56,
      "text": "that has its own hidden rip currents."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.14,
      "end": 135.18,
      "text": "Your goal for this section is to develop a lifeguard's observational skills"
    },
    {
      "start": 135.18,
      "end": 138.08,
      "text": "so you can recognize these digital hazards on site."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.9,
      "end": 141.62,
      "text": "This graphically is out three questions to spot AI failures."
    },
    {
      "start": 142.54,
      "end": 145.14,
      "text": "Why can AI sound so sure and still be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "start": 145.9,
      "end": 147.98,
      "text": "When might I be trusting AI too much?"
    },
    {
      "start": 148.7,
      "end": 150.94,
      "text": "And if AI can create convincing fakes,"
    },
    {
      "start": 151.54,
      "end": 153.76,
      "text": "what should I check before trusting what I see or hear?"
    },
    {
      "start": 154.4,
      "end": 156.76,
      "text": "By actively asking these three questions,"
    },
    {
      "start": 157.14,
      "end": 161.46,
      "text": "you give yourself the exact tools required to map out the hidden currents"
    },
    {
      "start": 161.46,
      "end": 163.22,
      "text": "before you ever begin working."
    },
    {
      "start": 163.92,
      "end": 167.3,
      "text": "This image reveals the ultimate thesis of this lesson."
    },
    {
      "start": 168.16,
      "end": 171.58,
      "text": "When artificial intelligence fails, nothing looks broken."
    },
    {
      "start": 172.46,
      "end": 176.34,
      "text": "We are going to turn you from a passive user into a vigilant observer"
    },
    {
      "start": 176.34,
      "end": 178.62,
      "text": "and teach you how to read the water."
    },
    {
      "start": 179.4,
      "end": 180.52,
      "text": "You now have the correct mindset."
    },
    {
      "start": 181.32,
      "end": 185.98,
      "text": "Let's start the specific training required to spot those invisible digital dangers."
    }
  ],
